  "description": "1.6.4.0 plus n°48-n°51, a test image for the coordinator (no version digit of its own: the screens still show 1.6.4.0). n°48: after a beat change the Reverse LED shows the reverse of the new beat (16 Beats / 16 Mutes: it goes out with the live reverse). n°49: « Mixer » (Pads + Sounds) opens the Mixer after the Compression / Distortion or compressor envelope page. n°50: in 16 Time Steps a pad lights when its grid cell holds a note of the selected sound in any of its steps, and a press on a lit pad clears those notes. n°51: with the sequencer stopped, Roll / arpeggio repeats fall on the grid (swing at 1/16) instead of the press time and no longer drift one tick per loop; the Momentary Roll footswitch turns Roll on while pressed and off when released. Voice, Panel and SAM unchanged.",
